---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { breadcrumbs } from '../lib/schema';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | AXIS ICON STRUCTURE"
  description="How AXIS ICON STRUCTURE collects, uses and protects the personal information you send through this website's inquiry forms."
  path="/privacy-policy"
  schema={[breadcrumbs('Privacy Policy', '/privacy-policy')]}
>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-banner">
      <div class="container"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1></div>
    </section>
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="container prose">
        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>When you send an inquiry we receive your name, company, email address, phone number, project location, message and any file you attach.</p>
        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <p>We use this information only to respond to your inquiry and discuss your project. We do not sell it.</p>
        <h2>Attachments</h2>
        <p>Your message and any file you attach are delivered to our team by email through our email provider, Brevo. They are not stored on or published through this website.</p>
        <h2>Spam protection</h2>
        <p>Our forms use Cloudflare Turnstile to block automated submissions. Cloudflare processes technical information about your visit for this purpose.</p>
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>This website is run by AXIS ICON STRUCTURE, with offices in Al Khobar, Saudi Arabia and Multan, Pakistan. In this policy, "we" and "us" mean AXIS ICON STRUCTURE.</p>
        <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
        <p>This website does not use analytics, advertising or tracking cookies, and we do not build profiles of visitors. The security check on our forms may set a technical cookie that Cloudflare needs to tell people and automated programs apart.</p>
        <h2>Technical information</h2>
        <p>Like any website, our hosting provider receives technical information when a page is requested, such as your IP address, browser type and the page you asked for. This is used to deliver and protect the website.</p>
        <h2>WhatsApp, phone and email links</h2>
        <p>When you contact us through a WhatsApp, phone or email link, the conversation happens in that app or service, and its own privacy terms apply to the information you share there.</p>
        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>Inquiries are kept in our email for as long as we need them to answer you and to keep a record of our business conversations. You can ask us to delete them at any time.</p>
        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>You can ask us what information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. Email us and we will reply as soon as we can.</p>
        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>If we change how we handle personal information, we will update this page. This version was last updated in November 2026.</p>
        <h2>Contact us</h2>
        <p>To ask about or remove your information, email <a href="mailto:info@axisiconstructure.com">info@axisiconstructure.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
